    "title": "Rate-half distance-three quadratic locator-rank gate",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "On the official pair-Lagrange distance-three chart, let V be the X-coefficient space spanned by A and the e polynomials B A/D_i. Its quadratic product space has dimension at most 3e+1. Consequently the quadratic Veronese matrix of the 6e+3 external monic locator vectors has rank at most 3e+1, giving at least 3e+2 row dependencies and e(e-3)/2 independent quadratic equations. This is a necessary gate, not an exclusion of the chart.",
